Do you have forklift and reach truck experience and are you looking for a new opportunity in logistics? Then we have the perfect role for you!

What are you going to do?
As a Logistics Employee, your daily tasks will include:

- Loading and unloading incoming and outgoing goods;
- Operating a forklift and reach truck
- Receiving, checking, and storing products;
- Picking and preparing orders for shipment;
- Moving materials within the warehouse;
- Ensuring accurate inventory management;
- Keeping the warehouse clean, safe, and organized;
- Working together with colleagues to ensure smooth logistics processes..

What do we offer?
- Full-time position in day shift
- Starting salary of €16.17 gross per hour.
- Day shift working hours from 07:30 until 16:00;
- Travel allowance;
- Opportunity to work in a professional and stable organization;
- Training and development opportunities;
- Long-term employment prospects.

Where will you work?
The company is a leading provider of high-quality packaging solutions for the high-tech industry. The company specializes in the production, cleaning, management, and logistics of industrial packaging materials for customers around the world. Innovation, quality, and customer satisfaction are at the heart of everything they do.

What do we ask?
- Good command of English (minimum B1 level);
- A valid Forklift Certificate;
- A valid Reach Truck Certificate;
- Experience in logistics or warehousing is preferred;
- Ability to work accurately and independently;
- Reliable, proactive, and safety-conscious attitude;
- Available full-time.

Are you interested?
Are you ready to take the next step in your logistics career?

Apply today and join a team where your contribution makes a difference every day.

📞 For more information, please contact Gigi Rutten at +31 6 41152132. We look forward to hearing from you!

Are you looking for an active job with variety in your tasks? FedEx in Duiven is looking for logistic employees. Your job is to make sure that all packages will reach their destination in time.

Your hourly salary can be €21,22 including shift allowance.

What are you going to do?
In this dynamic role, you'll ensure the smooth running of the sorting process. Your duties include:

• Sorting and processing incoming packages;

• Efficiently loading packages onto trucks;

• Collaborating with colleagues to meet deadlines.

You'll work the following shifts:

2:30 PM – 11:00 PM

5:30 PM – 1:00 AM

11:00 PM – 7:00 AM

What do we offer?
• Gross hourly wage of €15,16, with allowances up to €21,22 per hour;

• Prospects of permanent employment with FedEx;

• 8% holiday allowance and 25 vacation days;

• Travel allowance of €0,25 per kilometer;

• Pension accrual through Adecco from age 18;

• Access to the Adecco Academy for training and courses;

• A pleasant, safe work environment with dedicated colleagues.

Where will you work?
FedEx is one of the world's largest logistics service providers, shipping millions of packages daily from Duiven to over 200 countries. Working safely, collaborating, and continuously growing are our top priorities. Your efforts are recognized and appreciated.

What do we ask?
• You speak Dutch or English fluently;

• You can apply for a Certificate of Conduct (costs will be reimbursed);

• You have your own transportation;

• You can be deployed flexible.

Are you interested?
Ready to get started? Click the application button and take the next step in your career!

Questions? Send a message or call Sanne at 06 42506892. You can apply for this position until September 27th, 2026.
